# Session start briefing

Before changing code or docs:

1. Read the newest file in `research/daily-briefs/`.
2. Read recent files in `research/random-thoughts/`.
3. Read `docs/framework/honesty-ledger.md` — do not contradict Unknown rows without a new probe.
4. Read `docs/02-requirements/fr-nfr.md` when touching behavior. IDs are frozen.
5. Read `AGENTS.md` and ADR-002 for the loop (one milestone → one branch → one GitHub PR; author ≠ merger).

Tracker is GitHub (`gh`). Do not start a GitLab or Pages workflow.
